    "title_en": "The first law of black hole mechanics in conformal Einstein-Power-Yang-Mills theory",
    "abstract_en": "In the framework of the Iyer-Wald formalism, the first law of black hole mechanics is examined within the context of conformal Einstein-power-Yang-Mills (CEPYM) theory. By comparing two inffnitesimally neighbouring stationary black hole solutions, we obtain the explicit analytical expression for the first law of black hole thermodynamics in CEPYM theory.",
